# The conformance fixtures and the worked-example expected output are read and
# compared byte-exact. Force LF on every checkout so a Windows autocrlf clone
# does not append CR to suite names, fixture paths, or expected lines -- a
# trailing CR turns "segmentation" into "segmentation\r" (missing suite) and a
# fixture path into an unopenable name (USE_ERROR: Invalid argument).
conformance/fixtures/** text eol=lf
examples/EXPECTED_OUTPUT.md text eol=lf
examples/catalogs/** text eol=lf
share/** text eol=lf
